      <span class="eyebrow sky reveal">For contractors</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">The handover clean, handled</h2>
      <p class="lead center reveal d2">Every builder needs a proper clean at handover, and it is rarely your team's strength. Hand it to us. We clean to a construction standard, protect your new finishes, and make your handover look as good as your build.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-auto">
      <div class="feat ac-blue reveal"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5 18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5 6 18"/></svg></div><h3>Fine dust removal</h3><p>We vacuum before we wipe and work from the ceiling down, so the fine construction dust leaves the building instead of moving around inside it.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-sky reveal d1"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Finish-safe method</h3><p>Chemicals chosen by surface type so new floors, worktops, glass and fittings are never damaged or dulled.</p></div>
